{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡瞬息萬變，TVB新聞+「學習新體驗」讓學生於課堂外隨時緊扣世界脈搏，多角度理解時事，培養媒體素養與分析能力，在真實新聞資訊情境中擴闊視野。 <br/><br/>即睇短片，了解活動細節！<br/><br/>☞ <a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/topics/198-TVB%E6%96%B0%E8%81%9E%E5%AD%B8%E7%BF%92%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%94%E9%A9%97%E6%99%82%E4%BA%8B%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A%E9%9A%A8%E8%BA%AB%E5%AD%B8%E7%92%B0%E7%90%83%E8%A6%96%E9%87%8E%E7%9E%AC%E9%96%93%E9%80%9A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">TVB新聞+　學習新體驗｜即進入議題頁</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T12:00:49.634954+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}